{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_e59ba9dfaa66","title":"知乎日报","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658599&idx=1&sn=985e5dba2578d4a9eef2b1f95ef0fd82&chksm=8aefe08f36c0e499a4eb8e9cfd5232037fcb6362484149500dff4363216eb717a80bccb9015e&scene=126&sessionid=1795076039#rd","description":"知乎官方订阅号，每日精选知乎热门、有趣内容","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"知乎日报","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FUOCHvzUGAIWg6z2Qs1yTHicbpqJwAUFRtJ5nhXPMb35XhGb6OESOg9OianbhYibThkZQiclOv5GN4z8%2F0","updated":"2026-11-19T07:55:57.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MjM5MDM4MDExNQ%3D%3D:2832658599:1","title":"在深圳一起边吃边聊：AI 数据的下一站","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658599&idx=1&sn=985e5dba2578d4a9eef2b1f95ef0fd82&chksm=8aefe08f36c0e499a4eb8e9cfd5232037fcb6362484149500dff4363216eb717a80bccb9015e&scene=126&sessionid=1795076039#rd","description":"当 post-training 的算法与框架逐渐成熟，模型能力的提升越来越依赖数据；但数据的「质量」既难定义、也难验证，真正稀缺的或许不是生成数据的能力，而是知道模型缺什么、能把需求转化为有效训练任务，以及获得真实反馈的机会。 \t \n\n身处 AI 数据一线，我们也不断看到 synthetic data、RL environment、benchmark 与专家数据之间的边界被重新定义——热闹背后，仍有许多值得认真讨论的问题。 \t\n\n因此，我们想邀请大家来一次真诚的小饭桌交流：聊聊各自对 AI 数据行业的观察、困惑与判断，不设标准答案，一起围桌畅所欲言，边吃边聊 \t \n\n🏠 主办：SoTALab \n🎙️ 主持：Jinyan Su\n🕙 时间：11.28/11.29 \t \n\n想加入这桌的朋友，欢迎扫码报名 💌","content":"<p>当 post-training 的算法与框架逐渐成熟，模型能力的提升越来越依赖数据；但数据的「质量」既难定义、也难验证，真正稀缺的或许不是生成数据的能力，而是知道模型缺什么、能把需求转化为有效训练任务，以及获得真实反馈的机会。 \t <br /><br />身处 AI 数据一线，我们也不断看到 synthetic data、RL environment、benchmark 与专家数据之间的边界被重新定义——热闹背后，仍有许多值得认真讨论的问题。 \t<br /><br />因此，我们想邀请大家来一次真诚的小饭桌交流：聊聊各自对 AI 数据行业的观察、困惑与判断，不设标准答案，一起围桌畅所欲言，边吃边聊 \t <br /><br />🏠 主办：SoTALab <br />🎙️ 主持：Jinyan Su<br />🕙 时间：11.28/11.29 \t <br /><br />想加入这桌的朋友，欢迎扫码报名 💌</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlHcQHbVA3C6twFVTaCy4PgSb72PMNkibmbBhyYHrdTODggBV5kEoHpblmV9BL74dxIDYf3opIt5eDFd6DWrgXRkn3nQyQON7A60%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlGeb9WSsJMNqYria6eh7bLp6ibD61dOKF2libWRXwJnibYI6me1FsHFzqW3tMVkGVtR2keD7J861IC6qmUE0PGHgSkPJBUjdibegMkk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlHcQHbVA3C6twFVTaCy4PgSb72PMNkibmbBhyYHrdTODggBV5kEoHpblmV9BL74dxIDYf3opIt5eDFd6DWrgXRkn3nQyQON7A60%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-19T07:55:57.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MjM5MDM4MDExNQ%3D%3D:2832658572:1","title":"🥚 为什么豆包画不对 13 个鸡蛋？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658572&idx=1&sn=2406d8a581eb305251803a586265deb3&chksm=8a488073cc5dcdba6d9540481175bd9e0e06f85b00eabca5fc26284f1f6d51d30a66103a7411&scene=126&sessionid=1795076039#rd","description":"许久不见的<a class=\"wx_topic_link\" topic-id=\"mwm71io8-2gnkvc\" style=\"color: var(--weui-LINK) !important;\" data-topic=\"1\" data-recommend=\"0\">#刁难大模型</a> 系列终于又有更新[旺柴]\n\n有网友让豆包生成一盒装着 13 个鸡蛋的图片，结果尝试十几次，数量依然不准确。\n\n这是为什么？\n\n知乎答主 黄河边儿 解释，这与图像生成模型的工作方式有关：AI 更擅长学习和生成视觉特征，而不是像人一样先数清数量、再逐个绘制。\n\n🤔看起来简单的计数任务，对图像生成 AI 来说，反而可能是个难题。\n\n你还遇到过哪些 AI 无法做到的简单任务？","content":"<p>许久不见的<a class=\"wx_topic_link\" style=\"color: #576b95;\">#刁难大模型</a> 系列终于又有更新[旺柴]<br /><br />有网友让豆包生成一盒装着 13 个鸡蛋的图片，结果尝试十几次，数量依然不准确。<br /><br />这是为什么？<br /><br />知乎答主 黄河边儿 解释，这与图像生成模型的工作方式有关：AI 更擅长学习和生成视觉特征，而不是像人一样先数清数量、再逐个绘制。<br /><br />🤔看起来简单的计数任务，对图像生成 AI 来说，反而可能是个难题。<br /><br />你还遇到过哪些 AI 无法做到的简单任务？</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlHE8EtROMwiabR5X51lS4zhYQkpz4TjAG7blGS7YJv2xbkZSS1ibMrmx77SUb2iceJ7uuyzpy2BA0vVKtGq2hN1fsoGXAesD6el8Y%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlGkFiaNtnStnOfyDPwibOGiblXMgrGLVATqvCQiaDcyNckrvj5icOeUtwQ6C3noFuj1liafdI8kgxnFOLN1Cdia4EFJkVicbMWuwpVuSyo%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlHE8EtROMwiabR5X51lS4zhYQkpz4TjAG7blGS7YJv2xbkZSS1ibMrmx77SUb2iceJ7uuyzpy2BA0vVKtGq2hN1fsoGXAesD6el8Y%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-19T07:55:57.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MjM5MDM4MDExNQ%3D%3D:2832658566:1","title":"脑洞丨东北那么冷，为什么没形成吃辣驱寒的习惯？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658566&idx=1&sn=9e64343ce4759c5a548e08c99fc63333&chksm=8a38a3a4667a8f8ee48272e95181f37c55fc82d11fb941f3e7c8b999c77a5ca13352a530c744&scene=126&sessionid=1795076039#rd","description":"要想在东北的西北风中活下去，只能靠牛羊猪肉？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlFtbIRX3dwFmuGibf4HuxUW5kuG5RTiah5YHah2zOtKvrBp9nc9LANYBGnO1msZBFUL3yrZs0ZzW6od4ic0lAH8z5ibNLsYw6CYic88%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MjM5MDM4MDExNQ%3D%3D:2832658566:2","title":"影视丨对谈《善男信女》《像我这样的爱情》导演：拍下普通人的疲惫与爱情","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658566&idx=2&sn=06a59596fabcea70338cee3e7b17f642&chksm=8ae2c5b421c463b9042a51d5ea8acbdab6e4ad18e48dbccd41486ddc12972e9c1d22fd27336e&scene=126&sessionid=1795076039#rd","description":"来看创作镜头背后的故事。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlFzVkaFiaVnuNm4L7oibAiaKvTeAJYV1icSR63oBGojZlBVicIOlxmYdDjOMsfAm4Isuvh5ZCdhx9SSInP0nwK5hXibL3DueibhSxaVDg%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MjM5MDM4MDExNQ%3D%3D:2832658519:1","title":"生活丨为什么虾皮里总有小螃蟹？你还翻出过哪些「隐藏款」？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658519&idx=1&sn=fd8d1806c61398c00c5b156ac835c697&chksm=8a8fd0b79f3684db855fd432131ac48ac2c5bd04dc7b03ca0de95e359ab